    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this impressive architecturally designed 4 bedroomed residence with detached garage built on a spacious mature circa 0.77-acre site located circa 5mins from the award winning village of Birdhill & only 20 mins from the University of Limerick. Set in tranquil surroundings & presented to the market in pristine turn-key condition, Cillín represents an ideal family home upgrade for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this impressive architecturally designed 4 bedroomed residence with detached garage built on a spacious mature circa 0.77-acre site located circa 5mins from the award winning village of Birdhill & only 20 mins from the University of Limerick. Set in tranquil surroundings & presented to the market in pristine turn-key condition, Cillín represents an ideal family home upgrade for the would-be purchaser - Early viewing strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation to include - Entrance Hall, Open-Plan Kitchen/Dining/Lounge Area, Formal Dining Area, 4 Bedrooms - All En-suite, Mezzanine/Reading Area, Gym/Home Office, TV Room, Family Bathroom, Guest WC & Utility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": ""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Zoned oil-fired central heating to include under-floor heating on ground floor (Boiler upgraded in 2024). Mains water & septic tank. Monitored alarm system. High-speed Fibre broadband.\r\nScandinavian pine double-glazed windows & doors.\r\nLarge south-facing patio areas & composite deck area to the rear. \r\nNeatly manicured lawned gardens with mature trees, hedges & shrubbery beds to the front & rear. Further development potential under proposed new Planning Regulations.\r\nWrought iron entrances gates in sandstone entrance leading to kerbed gravelled driveway. \r\nBuilt in 2004. Insulation upgrade in 2023.\r\nLocation - Shannon Airport - 38mins, Killaloe - 12mins, Nenagh - 23mins & J27 M7 Motorway - 9mins."
      },
